<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέπᾰφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>untouched, unharmed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. παρέχειν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.24
				</span></i>
			, cf. Syngr.ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σώματα</span>”
				<i>not liable to seizure,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Per.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλευθέρα ἔστω καί ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					1532
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				97.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.584
			</span></i><i>c</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				193.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθήκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHamb.</u>
					28.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <i>unencumbered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PThcad.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>: c. gen., <i>unharmed by,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβρεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
